  "ruleText": "Ed 207.01 Who May Appear. A person shall appear in a proceeding by personal attendance or through the attendance of a representative appointed by the person.\n\nSource. #6348, eff 10-5-96, EXPIRED: 10-5-04\n\nNew. #8334-A, eff 4-23-05 (from Ed 205.01)",
